ationid": "152587388", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207394479", "personaname": "Ty", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198207394479/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 775, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 505, "last_played": 1737429455, "avatar": "9a6e415c3baf966f59778ab25c540faceed74500"}, "language": "english", "review": "great devs, great game", "timestamp_created": 1701358976, "timestamp_updated": 1701358976, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152585448", "author": {"steamid": "76561198795902883", "personaname": "Appleman145", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198795902883/", "num_games_owned": 194, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1414, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 697, "last_played": 1718469274, "avatar": "3a74b9e3f15b31bd5f82c67e2bda513912ffac5d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun rogue lite to play alone or with a friend, plenty different weapons and a good amount of classes. One of the most fair fast paced rogue lite/likes  I have played. Looking forward to playing more of this and hoping for some sort of DLC.", "timestamp_created": 1701356987, "timestamp_updated": 1701356987, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152584733", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006514297", "personaname": "Vivilyn", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Vivilyn/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 116, "playtime_forever": 11, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11, "last_played": 1602721625, "avatar": "3959a48c2b0894b6601058c3e6012186c2be2ca1"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game has some great gunplay, movement and audio but lacks in the areas that make you want to keep playing after the initial exciement. (My playtime is wrong, not sure why steam just decided not to track it, I had 3 hours before refunding)\n\nThere is very little content actually here and the levels repeat often, far more often than a game like Risk of Rain 2 (another roguelite). \n\nThe balancing also seems to have gotten way off since I last played it, now being even more difficult fairly early on meaning that if you dont end up RNG rolling the best meta weapons early on you might as well just restart cause the run is doomed to fail. Even the positive reviews are mentioning how many of the weapons are straight up useless.\n\nRNG is this games other problem. Going back to Risk of Rain, they have RNG rolls too but because they're frequent a bad one doesn't hit too hard. If you get a bad one here you feel it for a while and sometimes can't recover at all because of the aforementioned sometimes useless weapons.\n\nOverall its not a bad game, but considering they just raised the price for the 1.0 release, it has to be compared to other games at that price point and it doesn't hold up to them IMO. It relies on RNG but lacks balanced RNG choices and lacks a variety of levels ensuring repetitiveness fairly quickly.\n\nI frankly don't understand the positive reviews, it deserves some for sure but not 90%+\nit makes a little more sense when you realise most of them have very few hours on the game. Over half of the reviews didn't even play past 6-7 hours. You'll get more time than that out of Deep Rock, Risk of Rain, etc. for a similar price.", "timestamp_created": 1701356203, "timestamp_updated": 1701356665, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.396033555269241333", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": true, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152584339", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008330369", "personaname": "Dekrakken", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pauldekraker1/", "num_games_owned": 386, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 2605, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2605, "last_played": 1701227816, "avatar": "9136053de955d59552f9ebb01389750957ec4c68"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like", "timestamp_created": 1701355767, "timestamp_updated": 1701355767, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152583307", "author": {"steamid": "76561197999578767", "personaname": "OwNathan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ownathan/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 1268, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 440, "last_played": 1734795309, "avatar": "df0ed9ced06f9832aaedcf40fd0a8031081100c5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Top", "timestamp_created": 1701354845, "timestamp_updated": 1701354845, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152579640", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043875208